    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a0000000a0000000a0000000a0000000a0000000a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "I\u2019m sorry.$.$.$ $$$To be honest, $$I\u2019m still not quite sure
      what happened. $$$$$But it really looks like a part of my memory is missing."
    displayText: "I\u2019m sorry... To be honest, I\u2019m still not quite sure what
      happened. But it really looks like a part of my memory is missing."
