    pauseIndex: 0000000001000000020000000300000004000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Before we go to solve some puzzle, $$$$can I ask you something$.$.$.$?
      $$$$Just to make sure$.$.$.
    displayText: Before we go to solve some puzzle, can I ask you something...? Just
      to make sure...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 230000002300000023000000230000003a0000003b0000003c0000003d0000003f0000003f0000003f0000003f000000500000005100000052000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Y-$$Yes...?
    displayText: Y-Yes...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0200000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'Maya. $$$$As you can see, $$$I have a lot of old memories. '
    displayText: 'Maya. As you can see, I have a lot of old memories. '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000000600000006000000160000001600000016000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "But what\u2019s funny is that you\u2019re not in them despite the feeling
      that we\u2019ve been together for a long time$.$.$.$$ "
    displayText: "But what\u2019s funny is that you\u2019re not in them despite the
      feeling that we\u2019ve been together for a long time... "
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 68000000690000006a0000006b0000006b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Did I meet you in high school?
    displayText: Did I meet you in high school?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'Um$.$.$. $$$I think so? $$$Or maybe it could be that we met a long time
      ago and forgot,$$ and we reunite again? '
    displayText: 'Um... I think so? Or maybe it could be that we met a long time
      ago and forgot, and we reunite again? '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0200000003000000040000000600000006000000060000001200000012000000120000004e0000004e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Just like in some anime? $$Haha\u2026?"
    displayText: "Just like in some anime? Haha\u2026?"
    color: 0
