    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 11000000110000003800000038000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: What do you think about that?$$$$ Do you remember the first time we met?
    displayText: What do you think about that? Do you remember the first time we
      met?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000001d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Uh$.$.$. $$Well$.$.$. $$My memory isn\u2019t that good either. $$$So I
      don\u2019t know\u2026 "
    displayText: "Uh... Well... My memory isn\u2019t that good either. So I don\u2019t
      know\u2026 "
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 02000000030000000400000006000000060000000a0000000b0000000c0000000e0000000e000000300000003000000030000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "But our relationship right now is good right?$$$ What\u2019s the point
